WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.120
Hey there, fellas.

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:05.200
Put the kids to bed, cause today, we’re
gonna tell you about the opportunity of a

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.080
lifetime.

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.720
We know you’re used to getting spoon-fed
some lame anomaly by the squares at SCP Explained,

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.280
but don’t worry, we gave them the night
off.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.960
It’s just you and me.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:20.880
Allow me to introduce myself: I’m the proprietor
of a certain specialty gentleman’s club

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.960
that caters to a...Well, let’s say “discerning”
clientele.

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:26.000
You wanna know my name?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.040
What are you, a cop?

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.160
Get outta my face.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.560
Anyway, believe me when I say, the operations
of my totally legitimate business are deeply

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.080
tied to the activities of those narcs at the
SCP Foundation.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.560
There are plenty of so-called x“scary”
SCPs, or “awesome” SCPs, or god forbid

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.640
“wholesome” SCPs.

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.040
But I don’t care about any of that.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.600
The real question is: What SCPs are the hottest?

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:55.360
And I don’t mean hot as in literally, physically
hot, ya dingus, like SCP-001, the Gate Guardian,

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.960
and his crazy solar sword.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:00.480
Though I wish my bouncer had one of those,
it’d be nice to chop the freeloaders in

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:03.600
half at the..whatayacallit?..the “atomic
level” or what have you.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:10.640
I’m talking about SCPs that are total smokeshows
- And no, I’m not talking about SCP-3792,

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.080
an aerosol can full of black smoke that forms
humanoid figures.

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:17.040
But hey, if you’re into that, I can see
what I can do!

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:22.080
I’m talking about the kinds of SCPs that
they put an “Adult Content” warning in

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:22.720
front of.

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.320
Like SCP-4960, a literal sex and fertility
goddess - Lovely woman, by the way, we worked

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.680
together briefly in the 60s, but that’s
a story for another day.

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.520
Maybe you’re more on the furry side of the
equation with SCP-1471 and you download MalO

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:43.920
ver1.0.0 like it’s Tinder cause you Want
an appearance from SCP-1471-A.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.760
If you have a thing for silver foxes, maybe
SCP-106 telling you a few of his “war stories”

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.080
might be a good way to pass the time.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:57.600
And if you have a thing for literal foxes,
SCP-953, the Polymorphic Humanoid, might be

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:58.480
up your alley.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:02.880
Sure, she might trick you into killing your
friends and eating your own organs, but ain’t

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:03.840
she just gorgeous?

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.840
And maybe even thinking about the Scarlet
King and his big, hunky suit armor makes you

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:10.160
blush as red as the blood he loves spilling.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:14.080
I ain’t here to judge, we all like a bad
boy, and it doesn’t get much badder than

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:17.600
an interdimensional tyrant who wants to destroy
the whole multiverse.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.760
If any of this got you feeling a little hot
under the collar - and you’ve confirmed

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:27.040
already that you’re not just experiencing
a fever from a rapidly-progressing SCP-008

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.000
infection - then my classy little joint might
be the perfect recreational establishment

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:32.560
for you.

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:37.120
Of course, we work on kind of an honor system
here, so I’ll tell you all about this on

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:40.960
the down-low as long as you promise to keep
it to yourself, capisce?

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:45.520
Cause if you double-cross me on this one,
some broken thumbs and pried-off kneecaps

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.640
will feel like a free vacation from what I’ll
do to you.

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:52.080
If you wanna find us, head down to East St.
Louis, corner of

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:54.320
street and avenue.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.080
We’re pretty easy to recognize.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:03:00.800
From the outside, we look like a single-story
brick building with real pretty colors.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.040
Come over to the West side of the building
on Saturday at 2:00 AM, and buddy boy, we

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.280
will give you the time of your life.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:11.040
You’ll know it’s time for the fun to begin
when my boy Big Mike exits the building and

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.800
starts setting up the signs.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:16.800
One will be a sandwich board with a schedule
of the night’s entertainment, the other

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:22.320
is my pride and joy: The big, neon beauty
on the side of the building, reading “EXOTIC

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.760
GIRLS”
“or equivalent.”

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:26.320
Welcome to the Multi-Verse Strip Club.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:30.400
You make your way in with a few hundred bucks,
and trust me, you’re never gonna wanna leave

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:35.360
- Though, full disclosure, we will boot you
out on your ass if you decide to linger after

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:38.640
3:30 when the show ends, if you’re still
alive at that point.

00:03:38.640 --> 00:03:39.680
Did I just say alive?

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:41.440
No, I didn’t, you’re just hearing things.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.680
You should really speak to a professional
about that.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.840
Look, I’m not gonna treat you like a schmuck.

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:49.520
I could talk about how great the experience
at my club is until the cows come home, but

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:51.200
what reason do you have to trust me?

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:56.160
How about, instead, I tell you about the special
night a bunch of SCP Foundation D-Classes

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:59.120
spent in my club on their boss’ dime.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:03.280
I don’t know how much you know about the
barbaric practices of those squares at the

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:06.560
SCP Foundation, but they ain’t big on human
rights.

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:10.880
They farm out prison inmates to be their personal
guinea pigs, and they have the gall to call

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.160
us unethical!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:14.560
Being a D-Class is a thankless job.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.880
They get sacrificed to monsters on the reg
and put in needlessly dangerous situations.

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:23.440
Hell, if 106 escapes, one of them gets put
in a femur-breaking machine, so their screams

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.800
of pain lure him back.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:29.760
If anyone deserves a night of sexy fun in
my club, it was these three guys.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:32.400
Here, even a Class D becomes a VIP.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.800
And believe me, we hire our fair share of
Double-D-Class personnel here, too, and we

00:04:36.800 --> 00:04:37.360
treat them right.

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:42.720
The D-Classes waited outside the club for
Big Mike to come let them in, then paid the

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.800
door charge with their Foundation moola.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:49.280
Those jerks at the SCP Foundation made them
all bring in notebooks and pens to document

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.560
everything they saw.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:54.800
Talk about adding insult to injury: You can’t
enjoy a night out if your head is stuck in

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.720
a stupid notebook the whole time.

00:04:56.720 --> 00:05:01.280
You want your head stuck between a pair of
Wait, this is a family show?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:03.520
Oh, uh, ask your mom about that.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:04.720
Stay in school, kids.

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.560
Needless to say, when those D-Classes got
inside, they were real impressed with what

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:09.520
they saw.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:14.800
Our establishment may not look like much on
the outside, but on the inside, baby, we got

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:15.360
it all.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:20.720
Fine shag carpeting, mirrored walls, a disco
ball, luxurious and comfortable seating, and

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:25.280
a thick fabric curtain around the stage, where
the brass pole waits.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:30.560
The guys were excited to get some more action,
and we were more than happy to oblige.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.200
We started ‘em off nice and easy with the
Khünbish Sisters, the hottest pair of babes

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.280
the Tuvan Republic has to offer.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:41.280
They have this incredible routine where the
pair of them sit naked on a log, and begin

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:45.840
an incredible round of Tuvan Throat Singing
- the exact same routine they did in Eurovision

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:50.800
1999 - while giving each other a tasteful
shiatsu massage.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:54.960
Clearly, the D-Class fellas were enjoying
themselves, cause they made it rain on that

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:59.680
stage, and the Khünbish Sisters repaid their
kindness by singing a faster throat-singing

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.120
ditty - Which they performed in Eurovision
2003.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:05.040
Next came one of my favorites.

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:09.840
Helen Keller took to the stage, a woman as
inspirational as she was hot, dressed in a

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.600
Vegas showgirl outfit.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.800
Awooga!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.080
Am I right, fellas?

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:18.960
She did a very classy strip show for the D-Boys
while performing a choreographed dance routine

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:20.720
to the song from Flashdance.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:25.200
When the guys made it rain, she put a pause
on the dance routine and decided to recite

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:29.760
some poetry, which moved the boy to tears
and also led to them making it rain a little

00:06:29.760 --> 00:06:31.120
more on ol’ Helen.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:35.600
We figured, by this point, the boys were a
little more acclimated to our special brand

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.760
of sensual entertainment.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:42.160
That’s why we decided they were ready for
the entertainment stylings of The Fantastic

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:43.760
Zippy...And Trainer.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.280
If you thought the Khünbish Sisters were
a dynamic duo, then buddy, you ain’t seen

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.080
nothing yet.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.560
It’s a lady and a live orangutan.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:54.480
Oh, and the lady has no head, and also advanced
necrotizing fasciitis.

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.960
Fun fact: That’s the flesh-eating disease!

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:01.280
But don’t let that put you off, they don’t
call her The Fantastic Zippy for nothin!

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:05.520
Trainer, the Orangutan, gives The Fantastic
Zippy verbal commands to hit the pole and

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:06.800
do her routine.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:10.720
Sure, some parts of her might fall off in
the process, but that’s only because she

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.640
puts so much energy into it!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:17.440
When one of the D-Classes threw her a five-dollar
bill, she slipped it into her exposed trachea,

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:22.240
and Trainer ordered her backstage - Finishing
a routine that the surviving D-Classes would

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.200
never forget.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:24.640
Did I just say surviving?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:25.280
No, I didn’t.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:26.800
You’re just imagining things.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:27.680
Let’s move on.

00:07:27.680 --> 00:07:31.920
We decided, after giving them a performer
with no head, to make sure the next performance

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.920
had a little more bite.

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:38.480
We released the girls, which is to say, four
velociraptors in perfectly-tailored Japanese

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.440
maid outfits.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.480
They took to the stage with plenty of growling
and snarling.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:47.120
The D-Classes, admittedly, started to look
a little fearful, but I’ve always thought

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:50.080
of fear as the greatest aphrodisiac.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:54.480
I can only imagine that’s why two of the
three D-Classes decided to throw literally

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:58.480
