four very special gals.

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:02.800
The other D-Class split the rest of his money
between the trio as the raptors left, bringing

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:05.760
their spicy performance to an end.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:10.560
Still, I think maybe these raptor gals have
a future in more mainstream entertainment,

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:13.520
especially if they crossover with the SCP
Foundation.

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:17.120
Maybe we’ll call it “Dr. Kondraki’s
Raptor Maids.”

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:18.720
I dunno, we’ll workshop the title.

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.560
Give suggestions in the comments.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:24.960
Next, we proved to these D-Classes that we
can also stay up with the times, and provide

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:28.880
the cutting edge in sleek, modern, erogenous
technology.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:35.280
We did this with erotic_performance.exe, a
program that runs on the incredibly advanced

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:40.560
Gateway 2000 computer and monitor running
a Fenestra 98 operating system.

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:45.120
It hit those boys with a series of equations
and 3D graphical representations that would

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:48.320
surely drive any hot-blooded fellas totally
wild.

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:52.320
In the end, they inserted a five-dollar bill
into the computer’s floppy disc drive, and

00:08:52.320 --> 00:08:54.560
we moved them onto the next performance.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:58.560
The Council of Libidinous Elders were brought
in next, to switch things up.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:01.040
What, you’ve never heard of the Council
of Libidinous Elders?

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:03.040
Then you haven’t lived, my friend!

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:07.600
Each one is a levitating, gelatinous mass
filled with membranous fibers with powerful

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.840
telepathic erotic abilities.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:15.040
They sent mental transmissions directly into
the brains of those lucky D-Classes, leading

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:21.120
to feelings of brain pain, mild acute tinnitus,
and most importantly of all, overwhelming

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.040
physical stimulation, baby!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:26.320
We only had two performances left for them
at this point.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:33.120
The first was a little number we like to call:
Serial No. 223244-09-P. Okay, we lied, the

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.400
number wasn’t that little.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.880
This babe was all legs.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:40.880
Literally, she was just a pair of mechanical
legs attached to an engine powered by pure

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:41.760
ambergris.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:47.120
When the ambergris is poured in, she starts
the most elegant Riverdance you ever did see!

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:51.680
And for you crush fans out there, we even
put plates full of beetles underneath the

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:54.320
legs so she can smash them all up.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:58.720
The D-Classes loved it - Until the pungent
musk of the crushed beetles made them feel

00:09:58.720 --> 00:09:59.600
a little nauseous.

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.760
That’s what love smells like!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:07.840
And for our most awaited performance of the
night, we brought in a special performer:

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:13.760
The Foundation dweebs call him SCP-1093, but
I call him something else that I’m not allowed

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:14.480
to tell you.

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:20.240
He’s a handsome dude wearing a sumo-style
mawashi, with a head so bright you literally

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:23.120
cannot see it, it’s a highly radioactive
ball of pure light.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:28.000
And the version of him in my club also came
with a big, sexy, ornate stone ceremonial

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:28.480
knife.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:32.800
He leaped into the crowd and wrestled one
of D-Classes, before using the knife to remove

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.360
their organs in a horrifying ritual sacrifice.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.160
Did I say that?

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.360
No, no, no.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.760
You’re just imagining things!

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:44.400
Don’t just hear about it happening to other
people.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.960
Come on down to the Multi-Verse Strip Club!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:50.880
We’ll give you a night not even amnestics
will make you forget!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:57.840
Now go check out “Trapped in a Game - SCP-1733
- Season Opener” and “SCP-1861 - The Crew

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:02.400
of the HMS Wintersheimer” for more anomalous
spaces you certainly wouldn’t want to be

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:03.200
trapped in!

